d logs and via FLOWS_PROSE_CHECK=off."}, {"id": "plugins_flows_readme_copyedit", "label": "copyedit (fresh Opus agent revision with loss checks)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "plugins/flows/README.md", "source_location": "L134", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A fresh agent revises a doc for a reader outside the conversation; code refuses the edit if headings, code, links, URLs, numbers, checkboxes, tables or quotes are lost, prose drops below 60%, or the doc changed. Code can't see meaning, so the diff is shown. Run before gates on specs/plans/audit reports."}, {"id": "plugins_flows_readme_packs", "label": "Vendored skill packs (packs/)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "plugins/flows/README.md", "source_location": "L143", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "superpowers, ponytail, mattpocock-picks, pstack-picks, tob-picks, paper-lookup and security-audit live under packs/ which the agent does not scan, so they only load when a conductor reads them by path (${PLUGIN_ROOT}/packs). Written by tools/upstream-sync adapters."}, {"id": "plugins_flows_readme_overrides_marker", "label": "overrides comment marker (npm test checks quoted pack sentence)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "plugins/flows/README.md", "source_location": "L151", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "plugins_flows_readme_uses_json", "label": "uses.json + scripts/flows-uses.mjs dependency tree", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "plugins/flows/README.md", "source_location": "L27", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The 'What each conductor uses' tree is generated; npm test fails when stale. Installing flows installs every listed plugin."}, {"id": "plugins_flows_readme_upstream_sync_adapters", "label": "tools/upstream-sync/src/adapters (incl. self-revie